{
    "title": "Prothero–Robinson",
    "summary": "dy/dt = λ (y - sin t) + cos t from y = 0, whose solution is sin t: Rodas4 at fixed steps is fourth order when the problem is not stiff (λ = -1), and when it is (λ = -1e6, -1e4) its error is proportional to h / |λ|, first order in h but divided by the stiffness; and the steps Stiff and Adaptive take at the same tolerance on the stiff case.",
